es during puberty cope or real potential","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-during-puberty-cope-or-real-potential.1684420/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251126112104/https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-during-puberty-cope-or-real-potential.1684420/"},{"title":"peptides vs hgh","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-vs-hgh.1667987/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251216161011/https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-vs-hgh.1667987/"},{"title":"peptides gh eye area advice","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-gh-eye-area-advice.1612230/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251112121924/https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-gh-eye-area-advice.1612230/"}],"news":[],"social":[{"title":"RFK Jr. wants to make it easier to get peptides. FDA scientists disagree.","url":"https://lemmy.world/post/48870701","site":"Lemmy · health","score":39,"comments":5,"year":2026},{"title":"Arginine Peptides Induce Nucleolar Stress, Ribosomopathy and Aging in Mice","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=39796521","site":"Hacker News","score":30,"comments":2,"year":2024},{"title":"US FDA Expected to Lift Restrictions on Dozen Peptides Previously Banned","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47604616","site":"Hacker News","score":10,"comments":15,"year":2026},{"title":"Influencers are promoting peptides for better health. What does the science say?","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47141338","site":"Hacker News","score":10,"comments":2,"year":2026},{"title":"The Peptide Craze, a Surge in Use of Off-Label and Non-FDA Approved Peptides","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46783401","site":"Hacker News","score":8,"comments":4,"year":2026}],"web":[{"title":"BPC-157","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BPC-157"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Hair (scalp)","chain":["Peptide injected or applied","Healing and growth signals claimed","Hair regrowth hoped for"],"effect":"claimed","text":"BPC-157 and similar peptide stacks are promoted online for scalp healing and hair regrowth, as an experimental route to thicker hair. Research on BPC-157 is mostly in animals, and no human hair-growth trial was found."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["BPC-157, also called Body Protection Compound 157, is a synthetic peptide of fifteen amino acids derived from a protein in human gastric juice. It was discovered by Predrag Sikirić of the University of Zagreb, with a first publication in 1993 [1]. It is not approved by any drug regulatory agency for human use [1].","Research has been mostly in laboratory animals, suggesting cytoprotective, neuroprotective and anti-inflammatory effects, while human evidence is very limited [1]. The encyclopedia article does not mention hair growth, and no human hair trial was found. Online discussion of peptide stacks for scalp claims is therefore untested."],"infobox":[["Type","Synthetic 15-amino-acid peptide"],["Discoverer","Predrag Sikirić (Zagreb) [1]"],["Regulatory","Not approved for human use; WADA-banned since 2022 [1]"]],"sections":[{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found on BPC-157 or peptide stacks for hair loss. Human evidence for BPC-157 in general is limited to a few preliminary safety studies, including a retrospective study of 12 patients with knee pain [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Safety and legal status","paras":["Health authorities discourage use because human safety data are insufficient, and the peptide's promotion of angiogenesis raises a theoretical concern about promoting cancer or enlarging undetected cancers [1]. It has been banned by WADA since 2022 under the S0 category, and some jurisdictions such as Australia and New Zealand control it as a prescription medicine [1]."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[{"year":"1993","event":"First publication on BPC-157 by Sikirić [1]."},{"year":"2022","event":"WADA bans BPC-157 [1]."}],"refs":[{"title":"BPC-157","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BPC-157","source":"Wikipedia","year":null,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[{"title":"BPC-157","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BPC-157","source":"Wikipedia","year":null,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Peptides","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides.1836876/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260308202313/https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides.1836876/"},{"title":"peptides guide","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-guide.1834321/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260210134404/https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-guide.1834321/"},{"title":"Peptides","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides.1822048/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260226151347/https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides.1822048/"},{"title":"bpc 157 und tb 500 wolverine stack","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bpc-157-und-tb-500-wolverine-stack.1808329/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260203174735/https://looksmax.org/threads/bpc-157-und-tb-500-wolverine-stack.1808329/"},{"title":"peptides in australia","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-in-australia.1791688/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229131741/https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-in-australia.1791688/"},{"title":"peptides actually useful","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-actually-useful.1790120/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228171418/https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-actually-useful.1790120/"},{"title":"peptides etc","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-etc.1789633/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228103808/https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides-etc.1789633/"},{"title":"peptides","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/peptides.1789387/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228062331/https://looksmax